// GetFirewallEvents lists firewall actions for a project, with optional filters for time, host, IP address, activity, action, and rule. Filters are combined across parameters and matched as alternatives within repeated parameters; use the returned pagination cursor to fetch subsequent results. Rule names reflect the project's current active firewall configuration and active team rulesets.
